## 5. Web Application & API Architecture

* **Backend**: [lumen/api/server.py](file:///c:/Users/morbi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/isro-chandrayaan/lumen/api/server.py) built on FastAPI and Uvicorn.
  * Provides asynchronous job submission (`/api/v1/register`) with `ThreadPoolExecutor` worker pools.
  * Real-time WebSocket streaming (`/api/v1/ws/jobs/{job_id}`) broadcasting stage progress updates (`INIT` $\to$ `INGEST` $\to$ `PREPROCESS` $\to$ `NORMALIZE` $\to$ `MATCH` $\to$ `GEOMETRY` $\to$ `EVALUATE`).
  * Demonstration endpoint (`/api/v1/demo-data`) providing pre-computed orthorectified strips, registered GeoTIFF previews, and independent check-point RMSE metrics ($1.932\text{ px} \approx 10.59\text{ m}$).
* **Frontend**: [dashboard/](file:///c:/Users/morbi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/isro-chandrayaan/dashboard) built on React 18, Vite, and TailwindCSS.
  * Interactive 7-stage pipeline visualizer with stage status badges.
  * Side-by-side zoom/pan comparison viewer (`react-zoom-pan-pinch`).
  * Interactive checkerboard split-slider showing boundary alignment between registered images.
  * Metric cards displaying RMSE, inlier ratio, and GSD resolution statistics.

